  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Título</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">WARHOL BASQUIAT Famous Artists Pop Art — Genuine $2 U.S. Bill<span style=\"display:block; margin-top:6px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331;\">Warhol Basquiat — Artistas célebres pop art — Billete genuino de 2 dólares EE. UU.</span></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Año</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2022</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Medio</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Giclée de bellas artes sobre billete genuino de dos dólares de curso legal (<em>Fine Art Giclée on Genuine $2 U.S. Bill</em>)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación Facial</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">$2.00 (dos dólares — moneda de curso legal estadounidense)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.1